*** Add File:ops/certifier/README_AUDITOR_PACKAGE.md
+Auditor package builder — how to create the certifier bundle and manifest
+
+1) Pre-conditions
+ - Run hardware RT sweeps and ensure rt_slo_proof.json files are present.
+ - Run HIL campaigns and ensure signed HIL bundles are present.
+ - Run perception sim/hil run and retrain loops; ensure perception artifacts exist.
+ - Ensure cosign and rekor-cli are available and COSIGN_KMS_URI is set for signing the final bundle.
+
+2) Build the package
+ - python3 ops/certifier/auditor_package_builder.py --artifacts-root . --out /tmp/scout_bundle.tar.gz --manifest-out /tmp/scout_manifest.json --cosign-key $COSIGN_KMS_URI --s3 $S3_UPLOAD --vehicle ScoutAV
+
+3) Deliver to certifier
+ - Use ops/certifier/submit_and_track_findings.py to upload and poll for findings.
+ - Keep manifest and signed bundle URLs and evidence in S3 for auditor consumption.
+
